# Android Engineering Standards

- Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, Material 3
- Package: `com.rktuhin.shopflow`
- minSdk 24, targetSdk/compileSdk per `app/build.gradle.kts`
- Version Catalog: `gradle/libs.versions.toml`
- Verify dependency versions against official docs before adding
- 16 KB page-size compatibility required

See `docs/05-engineering/TECH_STACK.md` and `docs/05-engineering/BUILD_AND_RELEASE.md`.
